            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedol abeikin naka ninipese alomar mama ejai ekabaka Akasuero, kedaun ŋes aiswamakinio kwape ejaar ekisil loka aŋor, ilapio itomon ka luarei, (naarai kedoloto kwaŋin apaarasia nuka aitesegaariokec, kes ilapio ikanykape akinyet naka luesaete, ka ilapio ikanykapc aures namaa, ka iboro luka aiteseg aŋor,) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋes do ebunio apese mama ejai ekabaka, koinakinai ŋes nuekoto kere alosit kaŋes enyouni kotogo loka aŋor alomar togo loka ekabaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elosi ŋesi eboŋ, kobonun tupuruc toma togo lokiareit loka aŋor, akan naka Saasagas, ebwacit loka ckabaka, loidari abusian: mam bobo nin alomanar mama ejai ekabaka, dimikito isiyalamikinit ekabaka, enyaraunitai ekirorike.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
